Experimental: the C runtime float to integer helpers, _ftol and _ftol2, are one conversion.
MIT, as the files it changes.

A block that starts at the bytes of Visual C++ 6 _ftol or Visual C++ 2002/2003
_ftol2 is emitted as a truncating conversion of ST(0) to EDX:EAX, a pop and the
return, with reduced x87 precision. Doom 3 spent about a fifth of its translated
time in _ftol2 while loading a map (jit-blocks.txt, block 0x134a4b4).

